state='title';
dying=false;
useAudio=false? Keep audioCtx and songBuffer for replay; useAudio remains true but timeline stopped. Set useAudio=false? getSongTime would use audioStartTime stale. Title no update. For restart beginTimeline sets. Fine. Set audioStartTime=0.
ui.hud.add hidden; title remove hidden; pause/result hidden; countdown hidden; screenEdge danger remove.
